!PLOG/ 30 4.76E-06 5.2 23948 /
!PLOG/ 40 1.12E-05 5.1 23956 /
!PLOG/ 50 5.6E-05 4.9 24191 /
!
MCH1QX=MCHYO23+OH    4.0E+12   0.0   17000.    !mchyo23 is a lumped species  
CHXDCH2+HO2=MCH1QX    8.0E+10   0.0   6000.
