! ---- chx1*o consumption ----
! WJP: lump all the chx1*o radicals into one of its possible radicals
! Include in the abstraction rate constants all possible C-H sites:(degeneracy of 10).  Use cyclohexane as a model species
! Ignore effect of formyl site and consider all as secondary sites.
CHX1*O+OH= CHX1*O2J+H2O    4.88E5  2.451 -1160.0 ! WJP: use Sivaramakrishnan et al. CnF 2009 for cyclohexane
CHX1*O+H= CHX1*O2J+H2      6.5E06  2.40  4471.0 !secondary rule, Sarathy et al., Comb. Flame 2011
