!
! EJS july 07: Reaction of resonantly stablized ene radicals with ho2 (mchene+ho2=mcheneoj+oh)
! RC 11: R+HO2=RO+OH
MCH1N3J+HO2=MCH1N3OJ+OH 7.00E+12 0. -1000.
MCH1N6J+HO2=MCH1N6OJ+OH 7.00E+12 0. -1000.
