! EJS july 07: Beta scission of h to form aromatic
! Rules from HJC Table 3 IJCK 38: 250�275 (2006). Allylic Ea reduced by 1000 cal
! Beta scission of ch3 --- rule is addition of ch3 to c6h6: Holt and Kerr, IJCK vol. 9, 1977 
C6H5CH3+H=MCH13N5J 1.25E+12 0.51 1620.
