!
! Decomp of diene radicals.
X135C7H96J=MCH13N5J 1.00E+08 0.86 8500. ! Beta route leading to ring opening
                                          ! Matheu et al. Table 1 IJCK  35: 95�119 (2003) for 1,6 endo addition
                                          ! determined  rate as in MCH Orme paper Table 10 JPCA vol 110. 114-131 (2006). 
C3H4-P+C4H5-N=X135C7H96J 3.16E+11 0. 6000. ! add. of c2h3 to terminal c of c#c-c
                                                ! Addition of vinylic type rad to c c2h2 (ethyne)
                                                ! c2h2+c2h3=c4h5 from Benson,  IJCK (1989)
GIKC7H9-L=MCH13N6J 1.00E+08 0.86 8500. ! Beta route leading to ring opening
                                         ! Matheu et al. Table 1 IJCK  35: 95�119 (2003) for 1,6 endo addition
                                         ! determined  rate as in MCH Orme paper Table 10 JPCA vol 110. 114-131 (2006)
C2H2+C5H7-1=GIKC7H9-L 3.16E+11 0. 6000. ! add. of vinyl type radical to c#c
                                            ! Addition of vinylic type rad to c c2h2 (ethyne)
                                            ! c2h2+c2h3=c4h5 from Benson,  IJCK (1989)
X124C7H97J=MCH13NCH2J 1.00E+08 0.86 8700. ! Beta route leading to ring opening
                                             ! Matheu et al. Table 1 IJCK  35: 95�119 (2003) for 1,6 endo addition
                                             ! determined  rate as in MCH Orme paper Table 10 JPCA vol 110. 114-131 (2006)
C2H4+C*C*CC*CJ=X124C7H97J 2.00E+11 0.0 2010.0 ! add. of vinyl type rad to terminal c of c=c
                                                  ! Analogy with c2h4+c2h3 from Weissman and Benson IJCK (1989), 
                                                  ! Benson says Ea is lower limit
C2H2+C3H3=C*C*CC*CJ 3.16E+11 0. 6000. ! add. of vinyl type radical to c#c
                                          ! Addition of vinylic type rad to c c2h2 (ethyne)
                                          ! c2h2+c2h3=c4h5 from Benson,  IJCK (1989)
