MCHYO23+C2H5  =>  C3H6+C2H4+HCCO+C2H6  5.0E+12   0.0   9000.0 !est 
!
MCHYO23+O2    => C2H4+CH3CHCO+C2H3 +HO2   1.40E+13  0.0   47000.0 
MCHYO23+OH    => C2H4+CH3CHCO+C2H3 +H2O   2.50E+12  0.0       0.0    
MCHYO23+HO2   => C2H4+CH3CHCO+C2H3 +H2O2  5.0E+12   0.0   17700.0 
MCHYO23+CH3   => C2H4+CH3CHCO+C2H3 +CH4   5.0E+12   0.0   7500.0 !est 
MCHYO23+C2H5  => C2H4+CH3CHCO+C2H3 +C2H6  5.0E+12   0.0   9000.0 !est 
!
