!C7H15-1O2+C6H5CH3=C6H5CH2 +C7H15OOH-1   1.02E+04 2.5 12339.3
!C7H15-2O2+C6H5CH3=C6H5CH2 +C7H15OOH-2   1.02E+04 2.5 12339.3
