NBCH-2ENE+HO2   => NBCH-1N3J+H2O2   1.70E+04  2.50 8.92E+03 ! Scott & Walker CnF2002, estimate 
NBCH-2ENE+CH3   => NBCH-1N3J+CH4    9.22E+00  3.31 4.00E+03  
