!
! consume n-butylcyclodienyl radicals:
! WJP: H addition to the ring of n-butyl-benzene can form 6 different n-butyl-cyclohexadieneyl radicals. Each one has 3 different
! resonant structures => 18 structures to consider for decompostion paths.  
! Choose product paths that did not require addition of new species.
NBCH1N3N5J => C2H2+C4H4+PC4H9 8.61E+11 0.728 45635.0! lumped radical including nbc1n3n5j
                                 ! reverse is 1,6 endo addition, with vinyl radical adding to double bond. 2 double bonds in ring of TST
                                 ! analogy to MCH13N5J=>X135C7H96J About 3.e3 at 1000K
!ebch1n2nbn+c2h5=nbch1n3n5j ! include if ebch1n2nbn included in mech
H+C6H5C4H9=NBCH1N3N5J 4.04E13 0.0 4312.0 ! 1992 BAU/COB411-429 NIST Kinetic Webbook
                                             ! H adding to benzene ring. Aromaticity is broken, but lots of resonance
                                             ! nbch1n3n5j and nbch1n3n6j each have 3 resonant structures and are lumped into nbch1n3n5j
!
! nbch1n5n3j
!(lump nbch1n5n3j, nbch1n5n4j and nbch1n5n-aj into nbch1n5n3j)
NBCH1N5N3J => C2H2+C4H4+PC4H9 8.61E+11 0.728 45635.0!
                                 ! reverse is 1,6 endo addition, with vinyl radical adding to double bond. 2 double bonds in ring of TST
                                 ! analogy to MCH13N5J=>X135C7H96J About 3.e3 at 1000K
!
H+C6H5C4H9=NBCH1N5N3J 4.04E13 0.0 4312.0 ! 1992 BAU/COB411-429 NIST Kinetic Webbook
                                             ! H adding to benzene ring. Aromaticity is broken, but lots of resonance
                                             ! nbch1n5n3j and nbch1n5n4j each have 3 resonant structures and are lumped into nbch1n3n5j
!
! nbch2n4n6j
! lump nbch2n4n6j, nbch2n4n1j and nbch2n4n-aj into nbch2n4n6j:
!
PC4H9+C6H6=NBCH2N4N6J 6.17E11 0.0 7591.0 ! analogy Benzene+�CH3=Cyclohexadienyl, 6-methyl-  1977HOL/KER85 NIST Kinetic Webbook
                                             ! Holt and Kerr, IJCK vol. 9, 1977
                                             ! Only low T value: 372 - 484 K.  Looks reasonable compared to H addition
NBCH2N4N6J =>  3C2H2+PC4H9 8.61E+11 0.728 45635.0 ! Reverse ring openning is a 1,6 endo addition of vinyl radical to a singly carbon substituted double bond
                                                   ! 2 double bonds in ring of TST. .Breaks vinyl C-C bond
                                                   ! analogy to MCH13N5J=>X135C7H96J About 3.e3 at 1000K
NBCH2N4N6J =>  2C2H2+C3H4-A+NC3H7 1.19E+10 1.338 46444.0 ! reverse ring openning is 1,6 endo addition of 
                                                            ! vinyl radical to terminal double bond with 2 double bonds in TST.
                                                            ! analogy to MCH24N1J=>ACEC7H9-F About 8.e3 at 1000K
! nc3h7+chxdch2n2n4n=nbch2n4n6j ! include if you include chxdch2n2n4n(5-methylenecyclohexa-1,3-diene) in mech
                                  !  Its radical is benzyl, c6h5ch3!
!ech1n-bn3j ! do we want to keep this species?  don't have these types of dienes for MCH
!
