NBCH-2J+O2=NBCH-2O2 1.75E+14  -0.7  -506.0  ! Fernandes et al. Zador, PCCP 2009 for chxrad+o2=chxo2j, 50 bar rate 
NBCH-3J+O2=NBCH-3O2 1.75E+14  -0.7  -506.0  ! Fernandes et al. Zador, PCCP 2009 for chxrad+o2=chxo2j, 50 bar rate 
NBCH-4J+O2=NBCH-4O2 1.75E+14  -0.7  -506.0  ! Fernandes et al. Zador, PCCP 2009 for chxrad+o2=chxo2j, 50 bar rate
