NBCH-AJ+O2=NBCH-AO2 3.487E+014    -0.816    -536.5  ! Secondary-site iso-pentane(CC5H11+O2) and n-pentane, Bugler et al. rule, pentane isomers
NBCH-BJ+O2=NBCH-BO2 3.487E+014    -0.816    -536.5  ! Secondary site n-pentane (Bugler et al., pentane iosomers, 9/29/2014
