! reaction rate rule, Sarathy et al. rule, iso-alkanes, Comb. Flame 2011
!
!
NBCH-1J+CH3O2=NBCH-1OJ+CH3O 7.000E+12  0.00 -1.000E+03
NBCH-2J+CH3O2=NBCH-2OJ+CH3O 7.000E+12  0.00 -1.000E+03
NBCH-3J+CH3O2=NBCH-3OJ+CH3O 7.000E+12  0.00 -1.000E+03
