! nbch-ao2=nbch-aq-2j  5.0e10  0.0 20450.0 !6-membered ring. sec C-H, deg=4, iso-alkane Sarathy et al. 2011
!
! Correct for 2 rotors already "tied up" in the reactant => multiply Afactor by 3^2=9?:
!nbch-ao2=nbch-aq-3j  6.24e9   0.0 18650.0 ! 7-membered ring. Sec C-H, deg=4, Reaction rate rule, Sarathy et al. rule, iso-alkanes, Comb. Flame 2011
!
