NBCH-BO2=NBCH-BQ-AJ  1.716E+09 0.900 29500.0 !5-membered ring. sec C-H, deg=2, Bugler et al. 2014 (C5H11O2-2<=>C5H10OOH2-3), from Sharma et al. 2009
NBCH-BO2=NBCH-BQ-CJ  1.716E+09 0.900 29500.0 !5-membered ring. sec C-H, deg=2, Bugler et al. 2014(C5H11O2-2<=>C5H10OOH2-3) from Sharma et al. 2009
NBCH-BO2=NBCH-BQ-1J  1.231E+07 1.200 15400.0 !6-membered ring. tertiary C-H, deg=1, Bugler et al. 2014(DC5H11O2<=>DC5H10OOH-B) from Sharma et al. 2009 
NBCH-BO2=NBCH-BQ-DJ  2.877E+07 1.400 20800.0 !6-membered ring. primary C-H, deg=3, Bugler et al. 2014(C5H11O2-3<=>C5H10OOH3-1) from Sharma et al. 2009 
