NBCH-BO2=NBCH-BQ-3J  5.2E6  1.0  18200.0  ! 8-membered ring. Sec O-O with Sec C-H abstracted.  Ring to alkyl chain, deg=4
                                            ! analogy to CH3CH2(CH2)4OO-->CH3CH(.)(CH2)4OOH(1,7s) (prim to sec)
!
! Sarathy et al. 2011 rules:
!nbch-bo2=nbch-bq-aj  2.00e11 0.0 26450.0 !5-membered ring. sec C-H, deg=2, Sarathy et al. rule, iso-alkanes, Comb. Flame 2011
!nbch-bo2=nbch-bq-cj  2.00e11 0.0 26450.0 !5-membered ring. sec C-H, deg=2, Sarathy et al. rule, iso-alkanes, Comb. Flame 2011
!nbch-bo2=nbch-bq-1j  1.25e10 0.0 18700.0 !6-membered ring. tertiary C-H, deg=1, Sarathy et al. rule, iso-alkanes, Comb. Flame 2011
!nbch-bo2=nbch-bq-dj  3.75e10 0.0 24000.0 !6-membered ring. primary C-H, deg=3, Sarathy et al. rule, iso-alkanes, Comb. Flame 2011
!
! Correct for 1 rotor already "tied up" in the reactant => multiply Afactor by 3?:
!nbch-bo2=nbch-bq-2j  6.24e9  0.0 18650.0 ! 7-membered ring. Sec C-H, deg=4, Reaction rate rule, Sarathy et al. rule, iso-alkanes, Comb. Flame 2011
!
! Correct for 2 rotors already "tied up" in the reactant => multiply Afactor by 3^2=9?:
!nbch-bo2=nbch-bq-3j  7.8e8   0.0 21650.0 ! 8-membered ring. Reaction rate rule, sec C-H, Sarathy et al. rule, iso-alkanes, Comb. Flame 2011, deg=4
!
