!
! From Bugler et al. 2014, used Sharma et al. rates 2009:
NBCH-CO2=NBCH-CQ-BJ  1.716E+09 0.90 29500.0 !5-membered ring. sec C-H, deg=2, Bugler et al. 2014 (C5H11O2-2<=>C5H10OOH2-3), from Sharma et al. 2009
NBCH-CO2=NBCH-CQ-DJ  1.458E+09 1.10 33500.0 !5-membered ring. primary C-H, deg=3, Bugler et al. 2014 (C5H11O2-2<=>C5H10OOH2-1), from Sharma et al. 2009
NBCH-CO2=NBCH-CQ-AJ  7.033E+10 0.20 18500.0 !6-membered ring. sec C-H, deg=2, Bugler et al. (C5H11O2-2<=>C5H10OOH2-4) from Sharma et al. 2009
NBCH-CO2=NBCH-CQ-1J  3.42E6    1.2  13800.0 !7-membered ring. sec to tert, deg=1, from Sharma et al. 2009 (only has primary to tert)
!
! Correct for 1 rotor already "tied up" in the reactant => multiply Afactor by 3?:
