! Reaction Class 16:  Concerted eliminations (ROO=alkene+HO2):
!
! For HO2 eliminations occurring on the ring, the rates of Fernandez et al. are used.
! For HO2 eliminations occurring on the alkyl chain, the rates of Sarathy et al. 2011 are used.
! For HO2 eliminations involving the tertiary H atom, the source of the rates are noted below.
!
NBCH-1O2=NBCH-1ENE+HO2 1.13E+04  2.5 27397.    ! Fernandes et al. Zador, PCCP 2009 for chxo2j => cychexene+ho2, 50 bar rate.  
                                                   ! WJP: Reduced  by a factor of 10 because HO2 elimination can only occur if the -OO and the -H
                                                   ! are in the same plane (MM). This is rarely the case.  
                                                   !No pressure dependence since rate constant is approximate
NBCH-2O2=NBCH-1ENE +HO2 5.65E+03  2.5  27397.0 ! Fernandes et al. Zador, PCCP 2009 for chxo2j => cychexene+ho2, 50 bar rate 
                                                   ! a-factor /2 - for consistency with chx
                                                   ! WJP: Reduced further by a factor of 10 because HO2 elimination can only occur if the -OO and the -H
                                                   ! are in the same plane (MM).  This only occurs if the methyl group is in the equalateral position
                                                   ! which is not the lowest energy conformer.
NBCH-2O2=NBCH-2ENE+HO2  5.65E+04   2.5  27397.0 ! Fernandes et al. Zador, PCCP 2009 for chxo2j => cychexene+ho2, 50 bar rate ! a-factor /2 - for consistency with chx 
NBCH-3O2=NBCH-2ENE+HO2  5.65E+04   2.5  27397.0 ! Fernandes et al. Zador, PCCP 2009 for chxo2j => cychexene+ho2, 50 bar rate ! a-factor /2 - for consistency with chx
NBCH-3O2=NBCH-3ENE+HO2  5.65E+04   2.5  27397.0 ! Fernandes et al. Zador, PCCP 2009 for chxo2j => cychexene+ho2, 50 bar rate ! a-factor /2 - for consistency with chx
NBCH-4O2=NBCH-3ENE+HO2  1.13E+05   2.5  27397.0 ! Fernandes et al. Zador, PCCP 2009 for chxo2j => cychexene+ho2, 50 bar rate
!
