NBCH-AO2=NBCH-A-ENE+HO2 3.500E+10  0.71 30100.0 ! Sec with tertiary C-H broken, analogy with CC5H11O2<=>BC5H10+HO2
NBCH-AO2=NBCH-B-ENE+HO2 5.140E+09  1.01 29362.0 ! sec with secondary C-H broken, deg=2, analogy with C5H11O2-2<=>C5H10-2+HO2
